om/godotengine/godot/pull/121781.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-11T00:21:27Z"},"body":"In my fork, I tried replacing `linker=mold` with `linker=bfd` and it did not work, it kept using Mold. Why? Because the default behavior of Mold is to override `bfd` if you don't specify `make-default: false`: https://github.com/rui314/setup-mold#usage\r\n\r\nAlso, the installation of Mold was gated on `if: matrix.proj-test`. What... why? That makes no sense. I changed it to an explicit flag for installing mold: `if: matrix.install-mold`.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121781/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121781/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}